# Gmail/OAuth credentials - this project loads all Gmail credentials from
# environment variables only (see gmail_auth.py), but these are ignored
# defensively in case any file-based credentials are ever created locally
# while experimenting (e.g. via google-auth-oauthlib's own tooling).
credentials.json
token.json
client_secret*.json
*.token.json
